{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Hand one to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamGuards\/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and a denial stops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being a bare 403: the guard mints a fresh permission ticket for the pair the caller lacked and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attaches it to the thrown ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", so the framework adapter can return it as a header and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a UMA-aware client knows where to go for authority instead of only being told “no”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opt-in, and deliberately so."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Emitting a challenge means minting a credential — a wire call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the Protection API, and a live ticket, produced on a path the caller did not explicitly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. A guard that did that on every denial by default would turn each unauthorized request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into a Protection API call, which is a denial-of-service amplifier pointed at your own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server. So it happens only where an application asked for it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Failure is not escalation.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" If minting fails — the PAT expired, the Protection API is down,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the resource declares none of the requested scopes — the denial still surfaces as an ordinary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","isActive":true},{"text":" without a challenge. A caller who was going to be refused is refused either way;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting a Protection API outage turn a deny into a 503 would hand the outage a second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consequence, and letting it turn into an allow would be a security bug.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger"]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/init(realm:asURI:pat:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/asURI","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/pat","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/realm"],"title":"Instance Properties"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A configured "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WWW-Authenticate: UMA"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge emitter (CONTRACT.md §20.3, emit half)."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13UmaChallengerV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"UmaChallenger","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger":{"title":"UmaChallenger","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A configured ","type":"text"},{"code":"WWW-Authenticate: UMA","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" challenge emitter (CONTRACT.md §20.3, emit half).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/init(realm:asURI:pat:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/init(realm:asURI:pat:)","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/init(realm:asuri:pat:)","title":"init(realm:asURI:pat:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"realm"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"asURI","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pat","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AuthzError":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AuthzError","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/authzerror","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AuthzError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","abstract":[{"text":"Authorization failure (§2). Carries a ","type":"text"},{"code":"message","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and, when the server provided them,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the denied ","type":"text"},{"code":"action","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"resourceID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"AuthzError","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/umaDiscover()":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/.well-known\/uma2-configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" (§20.1) — fetch the UMA discovery document."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"umaDiscover()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/umaDiscover()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaDiscover","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17Uma2ConfigurationV","text":"Uma2Configuration","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/umadiscover()"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/realm":{"title":"realm","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/realm","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"realm"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/realm","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The protection realm named in the header."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/pat":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/pat","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/pat","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pat","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"pat","abstract":[{"text":"A Protection API Token: a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"client-credentials"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" token carrying the ","type":"text"},{"code":"uma_protection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scope"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(§20.2 rule 1). A user token cannot stand in — a minted ticket is bound to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that minted it."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/asURI":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/asuri","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The authorization server the caller should redeem the ticket at — normally this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deployment’s issuer, read from "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/umaDiscover()","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than concatenated by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand, for the same reason §12.3 rule 6 gives."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"asURI","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/asURI","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"asURI"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamGuards/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)":{"abstract":[{"code":"require_access(action, resource[, scope])","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (§11): the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"authenticated caller","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" must pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an AXIAM authorization check. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subject_id"},{"type":"text","text":" is the end user’s id (§11.2 rule 2), not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application’s service-account session."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamGuards\/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamguards\/requireaccess(_:resource:scope:umachallenge:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireAccess","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resource","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scope","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaChallenge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13UmaChallengerV","text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK0A12GuardHandlera","text":"AxiamGuardHandler","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}